@startuml seq-live-stream
title Поток данных: live-трансляция

left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor Streamer as streamer
rectangle "Ingest Server\n(~100 PoP)" as ingest
rectangle "Real-time Transcoder\n(H.264, 3 качества)" as transcode
rectangle "Origin Server\n(sliding window)" as origin
rectangle "CDN Edge" as cdn
actor Viewer as viewer

streamer  --> ingest    : RTMP push (OBS)
ingest    --> transcode : raw frames
transcode --> origin    : HLS chunks (2 сек)\n< 1 сек latency budget
origin    --> cdn       : latest N chunks\ncache hit = 0% (live)
cdn       --> viewer    : fan-out (миллионы зрителей)

note bottom of cdn
  10M × 5 Mbps ≈ 50 Tbps peak
  Thundering herd при старте события
end note

note bottom of transcode
  ошибка = потерянный кадр навсегда
  (vs VOD: можно перекодировать)
end note

@enduml
